a. Nonfenestration U-factors and F-factors shall be obtained from measurement, calculation, an approved source, or Appendix RF
where such appendix is adopted or approved.
b. Mass walls shall be in accordance with Section R402.2.6. Where more than half the insulation is on the interior, the mass wall U-
factor shall not exceed 0.56.
c. Reserved
