f. Includes oil-fired (residual).
g. Boilers shall not be equipped with a constant burning pilot light.
h. A boiler not equipped with a tankless domestic water-heating coil shall be equipped with an automatic means for adjusting the
temperature of the water such that an incremental change in inferred heat load produces a corresponding incremental change in
the temperature of the water supplied.
i. High-capacity space-heating gas boiler systems with system input capacities of not less than 1,000,000 Btu/h (293 kW) and not
greater than 10,000,000 Btu/h (2931 kW) in new buildings shall comply with Sections C403.10.1 and C403.10.2.
