RATING CAPACITY MINIMUM NUMBER OF MECHANICAL MINIMUM COMPRESSOR
COOLING STAGES a
DISPLACEMENT
≥ 65,000 Btu/h and 3 stages ≤ 35% of full load
< 240,000 Btu/h
≥ 240,000 Btu/h 4 stages ≤ 25% full load
