C403.12.2 Walk-in coolers and walk-in freezers. Walk-in cooler and walk-in freezer
refrigeration systems, except for walk-in process cooling refrigeration systems as defined in
DOE 10 CFR 431.302, shall meet the requirements of Tables C403.12.2.1(1), C403.12.2.1(2)
and C403.12.2.1(3).
C403.12.2.1 Performance standards. Walk-in coolers and walk-in freezers shall meet
the requirements of Tables C403.12.2.1(1), C403.12.2.1(2) and C403.12.2.1(3).
