served by the system hp and larger
Chilled-water plant and all coils and Individual plants supplying more than three zones and with design cooling
terminal units served by the system capacity of 300,000 Btu/h and larger
Hot-water plant and all coils and Individual plants supplying more than three zones and with design heating
