b. Compliance of multiple firing rate units shall be at the maximum firing rate.
c. Et = thermal efficiency. Units must also include an interrupted or intermittent ignition device (IID), have jacket losses not exceeding 0.75% of the input
rating, and have either power venting or a flue damper. A vent damper is an acceptable alternative to a flue damper for those furnaces where combustion air
is drawn from the conditioned space.
d. Ec = combustion efficiency (100% less flue losses). See test procedure for detailed discussion.
e. Units must also include an interrupted or intermittent ignition device (IID) and have either power venting or an automatic flue damper.
