11.5.2.2 Improved HVAC Performance. To achieve these credits, equipment shall provide HVAC performance
improvement in accordance with Section 11.5.2.2.2, 11.5.2.2.3, 11.5.2.2.4, 11.5.2.2.5, or 11.5.2.2.6. Equipment shall also meet
